## What it does

An e-legislative system that moved a local government's legislative process
online, covering bill drafting, committee deliberation, and public hearings.

## Approach

Led development end to end, replacing manual, paper-based steps with tracked
digital workflows for each stage of legislation.

## Stack

Python and Django on the backend, React on the frontend, containerized with
Docker and deployed on AWS.
